WEBVTT

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:15.300
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.090
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:16.870
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:17.580
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:18.370
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:20.240
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:35.280
<b>Restoration Plan No. 1

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:37.860
A forty-year-old building.

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:40.720
A tiny 7.3 square meter apartment.

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:43.220
With no bath.

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:47.260
Living like this...

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:50.920
I can't stand living like this anymore!

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:54.670
Not when I'm... I'm actually...

00:01:58.010 --> 00:01:59.590
<i>Authority!</i>

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:03.800
<i>Magical power!</i>

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:12.680
<i>Beauty!</i>

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:20.570
<i>As the Dark Lord's right hand, the Great Jahy
is the Dark Realm's second-in-command.</i>

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:24.790
<i>She is feared and revered by all...</i>

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:32.870
We're under attack!

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:48.000
Please save us, O Great Jahy!

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:50.350
She's here!

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:01.040
What's this?

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:02.990
It's just a little girl.

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:05.960
How terribly pathetic of you lot.

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:09.790
The Dark Realm is no place for little girls.

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:11.870
Begone at once.

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:27.520
What?!

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:37.950
<i>With the mana crystal that governs 
magical powers shattered,</i>

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:40.680
<i>the Dark Realm itself 
was doomed to fall apart.</i>

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:53.040
What the hell is this?!

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:57.000
<i>And without the mana crystal, 
the Great Jahy found herself...</i>

00:03:57.300 --> 00:04:01.340
<i>in the human realm, 
in the body of a little girl.</i>

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:07.680
Restore
the
Dark
Realm

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:06.140
I need to gather up mana crystals 
and restore the Dark Realm forthwith!

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:18.860
<i>I blame this blasted form!</i>

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:24.360
<i>Thanks to it, I've been subjected 
to most despicable treatment!</i>

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:28.280
<i>I'm going to gather every shard 
of the shattered mana crystal</i>

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:32.250
<b>Sprouts</b>

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:31.700
<i>and regain my own overwhelming power!</i>

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:38.880
So salt? Or mayonnaise?

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:42.950
You know what? Today we're going to be fancy!

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.050
It's time.

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:51.960
The time has finally come...

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:58.480
<i>The Great Jahy has not completely
lost all her magic powers.</i>

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:02.440
<i>With the small mana crystal 
still in her possession,</i>

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:05.400
<i>she can temporarily return 
to her previous form.</i>

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:09.420
Indeed, it's time to do my worst.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:14.040
Welcome!

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:19.940
Hey, missy, we'll take two draft beers too.

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:21.190
<i>"Missy"?!</i>

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:22.800
<i>How dare you address me that way!</i>

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:25.300
<i>Do you know who I am?!</i>

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:27.590
Two draft beers.

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:31.360
<i>I am the Great Jahy,
second-in-command of the Dark Realm!</i>

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:35.980
I'm so glad I found some good help.

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.350
She's such a hard worker.

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:43.280
I don't care to be wasting my 
precious power on stuff like this,

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.760
but I must cover my living expenses!

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:47.720
Missy, we need another round, too!

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:49.110
C-Coming!

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:56.080
<b>Original 
Izakaya  Maou.</b>

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:50.730
Can you take my order?

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:51.880
Coming!

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:54.190
Is my yakitori ready?

00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:55.480
Coming!

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:01.350
What in blazes am I doing?!

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:02.350
Living expenses?

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:03.860
What about gathering mana crystals

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:05.570
and restoring the Dark Realm?!

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:09.550
I don't have time for this...

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:12.810
Still, I need money to live.

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:17.710
Everyone served me in the Dark Realm,

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:21.100
so why must I serve humans in this one?

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:25.980
And what kind of cruel world is this 
that you cannot survive without money?

00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:30.070
Good job tonight, Hy-chan.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:31.720
<i>"Hy-chan"?!</i>

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:35.710
A-Are you talking about me?

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:38.750
Yup! You're Jahy-chan, 
so "Hy-chan" for short.

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:41.170
<i>You dare infantilize my name?!</i>

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:42.770
<i>This woman!</i>

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:45.570
<i>If you didn't own this establishment, 
I'd tear you to shreds!</i>

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:47.880
Goodness, that won't do, Hy-chan.

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:51.890
You need to smile.

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:56.310
See? Smile, smile!

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:59.230
<i>A feared woman in the Dark Realm
 such as myself</i>

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:02.190
<i>would never grace humans with my smile!</i>

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:04.790
It's important to put on
 a friendly face for the guests.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:08.050
You looked so scary just now, Hy-chan.

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:09.830
<i>And whose fault was that?!</i>

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:17.840
Like... Like this?

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:21.840
Still a little awkward, 
but you're doing great!

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:23.330
What a good girl!

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:25.300
That's my Hy-chan!

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:28.800
Not long till closing time,
 so hang in there.

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.730
<i>The humiliation!</i>

00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:35.480
<i>That on top of ordering me to smile!</i>

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:38.310
<i>I'll have you know I'm ages older than you!</i>

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:41.560
Two drafts beers, please!

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:43.260
Coming!

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:48.220
Excuse me! Could we get some plates?

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:49.650
Right away!

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:53.340
Check, please!

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.600
I'll be right with you!

00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:02.090
Thank you for coming!

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:05.200
I like your style, missy.

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:06.720
Wanna come work at my place?

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:08.170
<i>Just keep talking.</i>

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:10.420
<i>As soon as I've secured enough capital,</i>

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.840
<i>you'll be as significant 
as the dirt under my feet.</i>

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:17.350
<i>Curses. One cannot survive
 on bean sprouts alone.</i>

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:20.360
<i>I should've nibbled a potato or something.</i>

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:27.230
Er... I'm taking a break...

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:35.980
<i>The power drain is higher than normal too.</i>

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:38.320
<i>Please, just let me make 
it until I get home...</i>

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:47.060
<i>I didn't make it!</i>

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:48.620
<i>This is bad!</i>

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:51.080
<i>I can't let the boss see me like this!</i>

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:53.200
You deceived me!

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:54.770
You cheat! You fraud!

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:55.950
You villain!

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:57.550
You're fired!

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:59.000
<i>I can't have that!</i>

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:02.150
<i>If I can't work, I can't live... 
let alone gather mana crystals!</i>

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:04.810
<i>Please, mana crystal!</i>

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:07.810
Are you okay, Hy-chan?

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:15.320
<i>It's all over!</i>

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:17.780
Hy-chan?

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.290
Goodness!

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:21.220
You're so little!

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:24.230
I suppose the cat's out of the bag now.

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:27.430
I am Jahy,

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:30.080
the Dark Lord's right hand

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:32.500
and the second most powerful 
being in the Dark Realm!

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:35.340
I'm not like you human peons.

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:39.680
I spread calamity and
 misfortune wherever I go!

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:42.560
The hellfires of the Dark Realm
 burn like no other!

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.920
Shall I toss the likes of you into them?!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:50.840
I'm so proud of you, Hy-chan!

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:53.400
You were so terrified of the burner before!

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:58.560
But you can handle the fires
 of the Dark Realm!

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:00.450
Silence!

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:06.910
I don't expect a mere human 
to be able to comprehend my power.

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:09.490
You're right.

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:13.660
I'm sure I can't even begin to imagine 
the suffering you've been through.

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:14.920
That's not what I meant!

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:17.460
<i>Something's amiss.</i>

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:20.800
<i>Why doesn't this human tremble? 
Why isn't she stricken with fear?</i>

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:22.440
<i>It's not supposed to be like this.</i>

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:24.660
So be it, then...

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:28.080
I should've done this from the start.

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:32.780
I'll have you disappear now!

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:36.190
And starting tomorrow, 
I shall be the new boss!

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:51.290
You've had it rough, huh?

00:10:51.860 --> 00:10:54.270
You're always trying so hard.

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:56.670
You've done a great job.

00:10:57.870 --> 00:11:01.890
If you ever have trouble, 
come talk to me anytime.

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:05.680
Being so small must mean
 all kinds of difficulty.

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:09.690
Oh, that reminds me...

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:15.020
Pay

00:11:12.180 --> 00:11:14.640
Here you go. For this month.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:20.440
<i>Damn it.</i>

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:24.350
<i>I need to gather mana crystals already 
and quit this dump as soon as possible!</i>

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:25.580
Huh?

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:27.740
Isn't this more than usual?

00:11:29.590 --> 00:11:32.120
You've just been working so hard.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:34.770
I raised your hourly rate by 80 yen.

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:37.310
Buy yourself something
 nice and tasty, you hear?

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:40.590
You can also call it a night for today.

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:42.010
Wait one second though.

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:47.340
Here's some food for you.

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:49.040
Take it home to enjoy.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:52.370
Will you be okay?

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:54.380
Can you make it home by yourself?

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:55.280
Yes.

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:06.240
I shan't be broken.

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:09.210
I will not let this break me!

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:11.540
That stupid cow!

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:13.870
Just because she gave me an 80-yen raise...

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:15.930
Just because I get to eat meat now...

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:24.190
It's been so long since I had meat.

00:12:24.190 --> 00:12:26.610
It's super delicious.

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:32.710
Wait, what cause for celebration is there?!

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:35.140
I need to get my powers back!

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:39.520
I need to collect mana crystals 
and restore the Dark Realm without delay!

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:53.160
The jig's up!

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:55.580
Gimme my money!

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:57.290
Never!

00:12:57.570 --> 00:12:59.760
You come around, month after month...

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:01.630
You're dogged, landlord!

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:05.580
Well, duh. I'm going round collecting rent.

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:08.560
You're the one who keeps refusing 
to pay month after month!

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:09.850
Give it a rest already.

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:13.220
It's preposterous that I, 
the Dark Realm's second-in-command,

00:13:13.220 --> 00:13:15.450
should pay money to some dumb human girl!

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:18.510
You could be the second idiot 
of the Dark Realm for all I care.

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:21.390
That doesn't fly here!

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:22.940
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:24.430
<i>She's got some cheek!</i>

00:13:24.430 --> 00:13:29.510
<i>The boss and this girl... 
These two sisters are always slighting me!</i>

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:32.070
If it wasn't for my sis asking a favor,

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:34.620
I'd never let such a shady 
character stay here!

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:36.150
You should be grateful.

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:38.000
I don't recall asking for this!

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:40.860
Who would ever voluntarily 
live in such a dump?!

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:43.210
It's not worth the rent.

00:13:43.810 --> 00:13:45.460
Then get out.

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:47.430
No!

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:51.110
I don't want to live in a cardboard 
house by the river anymore!

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:53.220
Then pay up.

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:54.200
Never.

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:57.230
Fine, I get it! I'll pay! I'll pay!

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:00.190
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:03.130
<i>How do I get by without paying rent?</i>

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:06.150
<i>The Great Jahy was beyond shameless.</i>

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:09.260
O-Okay, I'll pay you the day after tomorrow.

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:10.370
No way.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:12.580
You said that last month and then ran.

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:15.130
Then how about tomorrow?

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:16.250
Nope.

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:20.070
I can't pay today...

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:23.040
I'll pay! Today!

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:24.630
I'll pay right now!

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:27.590
I don't want to have to wash 
my face in the river again!

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:29.310
I can't take sleeping outside anymore!

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:32.140
I was wrong!

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:35.350
<i>Damnation! Why is this happening to me?!</i>

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:37.560
<i>I did the lording in the Dark Realm,</i>

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:40.090
<i>and now I'm the one being lorded over...</i>

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:41.690
Hurry it up.

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:45.710
<i>I didn't want to resort to this,
 but I'm out of options.</i>

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:49.650
I haven't eaten for two 
days now and if I pay rent,

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:52.100
<i>So give up and piss off already!</i>

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:53.370
I won't be able to eat again today...

00:14:53.690 --> 00:14:57.460
At this rate, I'll shrivel up
 and die of starvation.

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:02.530
<i>What?!</i>

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:06.380
<i>Here I am playing vulnerable for you...</i>

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:08.300
What's with that attitude?!

00:15:10.530 --> 00:15:13.970
That's what I'd like to ask you!

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:17.100
I know you got paid yesterday!

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:18.980
Give up and pay me already!

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:21.850
Never! Never! Never!

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:25.140
You little pain in the ass...

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:29.770
And damn you for taking
 this mess of trouble in, Sis!

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:33.070
<i>Curses! How do I get out of this?</i>

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:34.820
<i>There must be a way.</i>

00:15:34.820 --> 00:15:36.770
<i>Think... Think!</i>

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:40.580
Boss? Boss, is that you?!

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:41.580
Save me!

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:42.700
S-Sis?!

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:43.920
Wait, it's not what it looks like!

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:46.040
She just refuses to pay her rent and...

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.940
Serves you right, buffoon!

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.680
I've made a clean getaway.

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:10.070
Quit yelling! You're disturbing 
the whole neighborhood!

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:11.990
You're yelling, too!

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:14.130
Shut up! Pay your rent!

00:16:14.130 --> 00:16:16.880
Never! You flat-chested freak!

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:20.080
You think you'll ever see money out of me?!

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:29.680
What are you two doing downtown?

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.800
This just won't do, you two!

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:35.030
Ryou-chan, you're her landlord.

00:16:35.030 --> 00:16:37.620
You need to be nice to Hy-chan.

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:38.640
What?

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:41.620
Clearly Ja-ko is at fault 
for not paying up!

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:44.640
Hy-chan, what would you do 
if you didn't get your pay?

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:46.180
I'd burn you alive.

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:48.380
Then go on and pay her, all right?

00:16:54.520 --> 00:16:56.740
There! Now you're friends again.

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:59.340
We never were friends!

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:59.340
What?!

00:16:59.340 --> 00:17:00.660
All right, all right.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:03.410
See, you got me in trouble!

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:06.170
What? That was all your fault!

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:11.760
You may have cheated me 
out of my money this time,

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:14.840
but I am definitely <i>not</i> paying next month!

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:16.550
Just pay!

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.520
<i>Thus the curtains drew on this battle...</i>

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:22.600
<i>for another month, at least.</i>

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:26.700
It's not here...

00:17:27.720 --> 00:17:28.480
Or here!

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:30.140
Or here!

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:34.400
My only mana crystal isn't here!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:37.420
This is most serious.

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:40.410
If a human were to get a hold
 of my mana crystal,

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:43.870
it would wreak disaster 
that not even I couldn't contain.

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:50.090
In the worst case, 
it might even destroy the human world!

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:53.380
And I can't show up at work like this!

00:17:56.990 --> 00:18:00.030
But if it's not here... maybe it's there?

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:07.010
It's rare to see you here on your day off.

00:18:07.010 --> 00:18:09.520
As little Hy-chan, at that!

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:11.400
I'm only here to look for something!

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:13.340
You're looking for something?

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:14.160
Yes.

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:16.280
A red stone about this big.

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:18.340
I need to find it at all costs.

00:18:18.850 --> 00:18:21.060
<i>I don't want any help from humans...</i>

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:23.190
<i>But this is an emergency.</i>

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:25.670
Help me find it...

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:27.000
Please.

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:31.290
Oh, I figured this was yours.

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:33.970
I even put it on to make sure
 I didn't forget.

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:36.260
My mana crystal!

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:39.530
Here you go.

00:18:46.590 --> 00:18:47.360
Boss...

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:49.930
How long were you wearing this?

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:55.050
Well, I found it after your shift last night.

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:57.230
So since yesterday, I guess?

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:00.100
You've been wearing this for an entire day?

00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:01.120
Yes.

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:07.380
Mana crystals bestow power
from the Dark Realm...

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:10.810
In human hands, they call forth
all manner of misfortune.

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:12.250
If you wore it for a day,

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:14.890
the effects must have been quite pronounced.

00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:16.300
O-Oh, no...

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:19.130
I knew it. I was too late...

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:22.300
So it's the mana crystal's 
fault that my shoulders

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:23.850
have been really sore since yesterday?

00:19:24.270 --> 00:19:25.600
What? Are you stupid?

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:28.970
Obviously these sacks of fat
on your chest are to blame for that!

00:19:28.970 --> 00:19:31.800
Do not ascribe such petty 
misfortune to my mana crystal!

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:33.060
Gosh...

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:35.930
That's not even the kind of 
misfortune I'm talking about!

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:38.030
Something much worse must have happened!

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:41.590
Like your whole house burned down, 
or you were hit with some mysterious illness!

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:43.380
You don't mean...

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:47.360
It was the mana crystal's fault 
that I had such a hard time

00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:48.950
finding the remote control yesterday?!

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:51.210
Your misfortunes are minuscule!

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:53.740
Even after I found it, it just barely worked.

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:54.920
Was that the mana crystal?

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.300
You'll have to do better!

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:57.920
What about my split ends?

00:19:57.920 --> 00:20:01.130
Stop saying every little thing
was the mana crystal's fault!

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:02.020
Was there nothing?!

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:06.120
Did any volcanoes erupt? Continents split?
Were thousands of lives not put in danger?!

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:07.740
Hmm....

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:11.140
<i>Nothing?</i>

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:14.050
<i>Are you kidding me?</i>

00:20:14.050 --> 00:20:17.140
<i>Is my mana crystal really so weak?</i>

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:19.780
I'm sorry.

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:24.820
I wondered if it was yours, 
but I had no idea it was so important.

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:26.260
Well, it is!

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:29.660
This mana crystal is my last 
connection to the Dark Realm.

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:30.940
Besides,

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:38.010
without this stone, I can't even 
return to my original form.

00:20:38.010 --> 00:20:40.340
Do you understand its importance now?!

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:44.050
If it's that important to you, 
you need to take better care of it!

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:45.430
Huh?

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:47.860
Do you know where I found that necklace?

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:50.680
Under a chair in the staff room!

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:53.100
<i>Oh, yeah...</i>

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:56.360
<i>When my powers ran out 
and I got food to take home...</i>

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:01.150
You were lucky you dropped it here.

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:03.490
But... B-But...

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:05.740
No ifs, ands, or buts!

00:21:08.310 --> 00:21:11.540
Here. Turn around and I'll put it on for you.

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:16.260
You can wear it while you work if you want.

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:19.080
Just keep it tucked inside your shirt 
and make sure you don't drop it.

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:20.770
No more losing it.

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:22.120
You hear?

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:23.620
Yes.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:25.740
Thank y...

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:29.340
I'm not thanking you!

00:21:29.340 --> 00:21:31.730
I'll let you off easy today!

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:36.610
But mark my words! Terrible misfortune
 will befall you sooner or later!

00:21:36.610 --> 00:21:38.170
You had best prepare yourself!

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:40.090
Don't forget to lock up!

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:42.980
<i>In truth...</i>

00:21:43.720 --> 00:21:45.870
This is this Hy-chan's, isn't it?

00:21:50.340 --> 00:21:51.490
Transform!

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:55.850
<i>My sister happened to see me right then.</i>

00:21:55.850 --> 00:21:56.900
The hell are you doing?

00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:01.200
<i>To make matters worse, 
I hit my knee really hard.</i>

00:22:01.770 --> 00:22:05.350
<i>Was it the curse of the 
mana crystal... I wonder?</i>

00:22:05.350 --> 00:22:07.600
<i>It was too embarrassing to tell her though.</i>

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:11.090
I'm so glad...

00:22:12.100 --> 00:22:13.820
I'm so glad I found it.

00:22:15.010 --> 00:22:18.000
I haven't been this happy in ages!

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:20.310
<i>The Great Jahy reveled in her happiness,</i>

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:22.900
<i>but it wouldn't take long to realize
 she was right back at square one.</i>

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:28.180
<i>She was not a single step closer 
to restoring the Dark Realm.</i>

00:22:29.070 --> 00:22:33.340
Wait, what am I so happy about?!

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:38.980
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:38.980
<b>Druj Asks No Questions!</b>
